ercised-for-nov-14-kansas-game</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/2/football-six-day-window-to-be-exercised-for-nov-14-kansas-game</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU cheerleaders lead the West Virginia football team onto the field at Milan Puskar Stadium." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/8/12/_DSC5912.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The Big 12 Conference has announced that ESPN and FOX will utilize a six-day window to announce the broadcast network and time slot for WVU's Saturday, Nov. 14 Big 12 Conference football game against Kansas at Milan Puskar Stadim.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/8/12/_DSC5912.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/8/12/_DSC5912.jpg"><media:title>WVU cheerleaders lead the West Virginia football team onto the field at Milan Puskar Stadium.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/8/12/_DSC5912.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 2 Nov 2026 11:57:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59627</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>